		{
			"uuid": "cfa4bf78-4bf6-4cff-9744-d7c483a7cca4",
			"title": "[Feat] Player character",
			"description": "- Player can jump twice. Second jump is significantly weaker than first. A small shadow should always be visible underneath the player.\n- Attacking hurts enemies, destroys boxes of loot, or push away loot. Attack is a small time window in which anything gets hurt if collided.",
			"category": "26929272-0dbe-4941-9cf2-829cf0257dce",
